/dev/block/platform/bootdevice/by-name/spmfw       /spmfw          emmc        defaults                  recoveryonly [cite: 33]
/dev/block/platform/bootdevice/by-name/scp1        /scp1           emmc        defaults                  recoveryonly [cite: 34]
/dev/block/platform/bootdevice/by-name/sspm_1      /sspm_1         emmc        defaults                  recoveryonly [cite: 34]

